OL,3,AMore than 43 million ballots cast so
OL,4,Afar in midterms early voting surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith less than a week to go until the
OL,7,FUS midterm elections - which will
OL,8,Fdetermine which party controls Congress
OL,9,Ffor the next two years - more than 43
OL,10,Fmillion Americans have already voted.
OL,12,FData from the University of Florida
OL,13,FElection Lab indicates that four to
OL,14,Ffive million early votes have been cast
OL,15,Feach day, a much higher rate than in
OL,16,Fmost previous elections.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
