OL,3,AMore than 43 million ballots cast so
OL,4,Afar in midterms early voting surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FTexas has seen the highest
OL,7,Fabove-average turnout rate so far, says
OL,8,FProfessor Mike McDonald, who runs the
OL,9,Fdatabase. Hispanic communities are also
OL,10,Fseeing a much higher turnout than
OL,11,Fusual.
OL,13,FOverall turnout appears on track to
OL,14,Foutpace 2020, and even possibly 2018,
OL,15,Fwhich beat the 1914 record for overall
OL,16,Fturnout in a midterm election.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
